This directory (`plugins/_disabled.gdsfx/`) is an original, but incomplete and
disabled, component of VisualGasic (https://github.com/xgreenrx-star/VisualGasic).
It has no `plugin.cfg`, so Godot never discovers or loads it as a plugin — see
`README.disabled.md` for why. It is superseded by `../vgsfx/` and kept only
for reference.

